<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Host Marriott started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Host Marriott started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of Host Marriott Corp as near-, long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Host Marriott gained 1/8 to 17-1/2 in early morning trading.</p>
</text>
